{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "Greetings, teacher!", "hi": "नमस्ते।", "r": "Sat sri akal, master ji!", "sp": "Student", "t": "ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ, ਮਾਸਟਰ ਜੀ!"}, {"en": "Greetings! Did you finish the homework?", "hi": "नमस्ते! गृहकार्य पूरा किया?", "r": "Sat sri akal! Gharelu kamm pura kita?", "sp": "Teacher", "t": "ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ! ਘਰੇਲੂ ਕੰਮ ਪੂਰਾ ਕੀਤਾ?"}, {"en": "Yes teacher. My essay is long!", "hi": "हाँ। मेरा निबंध लंबा है!", "r": "Haan ji. Mera lekh lamba hai!", "sp": "Student", "t": "ਹਾਂ ਜੀ। ਮੇਰਾ ਲੇਖ ਲੰਬਾ ਹੈ!"}, {"en": "Good! Read it aloud.", "hi": "शाबाश! ज़ोर से पढ़ो।", "r": "Shabash! Uchchi parho.", "sp": "Teacher", "t": "ਸ਼ਾਬਾਸ਼! ਉੱਚੀ ਪੜ੍ਹੋ।"}, {"en": "Teacher, give me a story book!", "hi": "मुझे कहानी की किताब दीजिए!", "r": "Mainu kahaniyan di pustak deyo!", "sp": "Student", "t": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਕਹਾਣੀਆਂ ਦੀ ਪੁਸਤਕ ਦਿਓ!"}, {"en": "Take it. Study well!", "hi": "लो। अच्छे से पढ़ो!", "r": "Lao. Changi tarah parho!", "sp": "Teacher", "t": "ਲਓ। ਚੰਗੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਪੜ੍ਹੋ!"}], "title": "In the classroom"}, "lede": "Schools, books and exams — Punjabi for the classroom.", "phrases": [{"en": "Open your book", "hi": "अपनी किताब खोलो", "r": "Apni pustak kholo", "t": "ਆਪਣੀ ਪੁਸਤਕ ਖੋਲ੍ਹੋ"}, {"en": "Read aloud", "hi": "ज़ोर से पढ़ो", "r": "Uchchi parho", "t": "ਉੱਚੀ ਪੜ੍ਹੋ"}, {"en": "Write neatly", "hi": "साफ़ लिखो", "r": "Saaf likho", "t": "ਸਾਫ਼ ਲਿਖੋ"}, {"en": "Listen carefully", "hi": "ध्यान से सुनो", "r": "Dhyan naal suno", "t": "ਧਿਆਨ ਨਾਲ ਸੁਣੋ"}, {"en": "Sit quietly", "hi": "चुपचाप बैठो", "r": "Chupp karke baitho", "t": "ਚੁੱਪ ਕਰਕੇ ਬੈਠੋ"}, {"en": "Stand up", "hi": "खड़े हो जाओ", "r": "Kharhe ho jao", "t": "ਖੜ੍ਹੇ ਹੋ ਜਾਓ"}, {"en": "Ask me", "hi": "मुझसे पूछो", "r": "Mainu puchho", "t": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਪੁੱਛੋ"}, {"en": "I don't know", "hi": "मुझे नहीं पता", "r": "Mainu nahi pata", "t": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਤਾ"}, {"en": "Repeat again", "hi": "फिर से बोलो", "r": "Murh bolo", "t": "ਮੁੜ੍ਹ ਬੋਲੋ"}, {"en": "The exam starts tomorrow", "hi": "कल से परीक्षा है", "r": "Kallh to imtihan hai", "t": "ਕੱਲ੍ਹ ਤੋਂ ਇਮਤਿਹਾਨ ਹੈ"}, {"en": "Study well", "hi": "अच्छे से पढ़ो", "r": "Changi tarah parho", "t": "ਚੰਗੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਪੜ੍ਹੋ"}, {"en": "You passed!", "hi": "तुम पास हो गए!", "r": "Tusin paas ho gae!", "t": "ਤੁਸੀਂ ਪਾਸ ਹੋ ਗਏ!"}], "quiz": [{"a": "teacher", "explain": "ਮਾਸਟਰ (master) = teacher.", "id": "pj-45", "lesson": "education", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["teacher", "student", "professor", "examiner"], "q": "ਮਾਸਟਰ means…", "topic": "education", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "ਪੁਸਤਕ", "explain": "ਪੁਸਤਕ (pustak) = book.", "id": "pj-46", "lesson": "education", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["ਪੁਸਤਕ", "ਅਖ਼ਬਾਰ", "ਕਾਗ਼ਜ਼", "ਅੱਖਰ"], "q": "Which is 'book'?", "topic": "education", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "read aloud", "explain": "ਉੱਚੀ ਪੜ੍ਹੋ — ਉੱਚੀ = loudly.", "id": "pj-47", "lesson": "education", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["read aloud", "write neatly", "sit quietly", "stand up"], "q": "'ਉੱਚੀ ਪੜ੍ਹੋ' means…", "topic": "education", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਤਾ", "explain": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਤਾ — ਪਤਾ = knowledge.", "id": "pj-48", "lesson": "education", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["ਮੈਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਤਾ", "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਯਾਦ ਹੈ", "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਸਮਝ ਆਈ", "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਆਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ"], "q": "Say 'I don't know'. You say…", "topic": "education", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "exam", "explain": "ਇਮਤਿਹਾਨ (imtihan) = exam.", "id": "pj-49", "lesson": "education", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["exam", "mark", "rank", "pass"], "q": "ਇਮਤਿਹਾਨ means…", "topic": "education", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "slate", "explain": "ਤਖ਼ਤੀ (takhti) — the child's first slate!", "id": "pj-50", "lesson": "education", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["slate", "notebook", "diary", "atlas"], "q": "ਤਖ਼ਤੀ means…", "topic": "education", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "study well", "explain": "ਚੰਗੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਪੜ੍ਹੋ — ਪੜ੍ਹਨਾ = to study.", "id": "pj-51", "lesson": "education", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["study well", "write neatly", "read aloud", "come early"], "q": "'ਚੰਗੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਪੜ੍ਹੋ' means…", "topic": "education", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "ਆਪਣੀਆਂ ਪੁਸਤਕਾਂ ਖੋਲ੍ਹੋ", "explain": "ਆਪਣੀਆਂ ਪੁਸਤਕਾਂ ਖੋ